<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>Finding Coordinates</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01923</md:content-id>
    <md:title>Finding Coordinates</md:title>
    <md:uuid>8bbccaea-ac2c-4d77-9afb-f87d961c00ab</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section class="numbered-exercises" id="sect-00001"><title>Warm Up</title>
      <para id="para-00001">Here is a graph of a function <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>w</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> defined by <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>w</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1.6</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>. Three points on the graph are labeled.</para>
      <para id="para-00002">
          <media alt="A parabola on a coordinate grid that does not have a scale or numeric values. The upward facing parabola intersects the x-axis at two points (a, b) and (c, d) and it intersects the y-axis at the point (e, f). The point (a, b) is on the left side of the parabola while the point (c, d) is on the right side of the parabola.">
            <image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_08_13_02_01.svg"/>
          </media>
        
    </para>
      <para id="para-00003">Use the graph to answer the following questions.</para>

        <exercise id="dcaecaca-551f-4428-b461-397612b1b26c" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem id="prob-00001">
            
            <para id="para-00004">Find the value of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>. Be prepared to explain your reasoning.</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00001">
            <para id="para-00005">-1.6</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
        <exercise id="ce7be0ea-3f67-4b38-83a3-2d3236f4b535" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem id="prob-00002">
            
            <para id="para-00007">Find the value of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>. Be prepared to explain your reasoning.
      </para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00002">
            <para id="para-00008">0</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
        <exercise id="_27d60512-5982-460e-b522-58cdcdf44e23" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem id="prob-00003">
            
            <para id="para-00010">Find the value of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>. Be prepared to explain your reasoning.</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00003">
            <para id="para-00011">2</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
        <exercise id="_1c23d2c3-40ef-43e2-a2c8-733c481fa5aa" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem id="prob-00004">
            
            <para id="para-00013">Find the value of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>d</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>. Be prepared to explain your reasoning.
      </para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00004">
            <para id="para-00014">0</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
        <exercise id="_8ae82ca8-9dda-4ca2-a107-d575990b42e5" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem id="prob-00005">
            
            <para id="para-00016">Find the value of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>e</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>. Be prepared to explain your reasoning.
      </para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00005">
            <para id="para-00017">0</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
        <exercise id="c1d3952f-c6e2-4b1a-82e1-c67eda6408d7" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem id="prob-00006">
            
            <para id="para-00019">Find the value of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>f</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>. Be prepared to explain your reasoning.</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00006">
            <para id="para-00020">-3.2</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>

    </section>
  </content></document>